Chromium 158.0.8127.18 -> 158.0.8127.33, for the 158.0.8127.18 tarball.

158.0.8127.33 is a tag on the 158 branch (refs/branch-heads/8127@{#1527}) that
has no source tarball (as of 2026-11-10). It adds 682 branch commits to
158.0.8127.18 (#845), 288 of them not PGO/orderfile/AFDO rolls or VERSION
increments: security fixes (MSE (two), the extension install move, the password
auto sign-in toast, SiteDataClearer, WebShare, PartitionAlloc's purge, service
worker teardown, Blink's animation triggers and animation timeline, scroll snap,
nested pseudo-elements, display-locked painting, video snapshots and
WebMediaPlayerMS reloads, site isolation's about:blank and escaping-popup
origins, File System Access's sensitive-path blocklist, viz's render pass IDs,
accessibility's unincluded subtrees, the HTTP cache's restarts, the GPU raster
decoder and Graphite flush, libxslt's pattern cache (unused: the ebuild uses
the system libxslt), V8's detached globals, TurboFan escape analysis and
register allocation, eval scope infos, and the V8, Skia, ICU, Dawn and ANGLE
ones in the "Roll commits from side projects" and the ICU roll), contextual
tasks, composebox/omnibox, AI Mode button, dictation, new tab page shortcut
reordering and other WebUI changes, PartitionAlloc's ThreadCache overflow churn
and quarantine option, the Mali GPU query flush.

Generated from the upstream diffs between the tags: chromium/src
refs/tags/158.0.8127.18..158.0.8127.33 and the dependencies whose DEPS
revision changed (ANGLE, Dawn, DevTools, ICU, Skia, V8, WebRTC), as served by
Gitiles, with scripts/chromium-delta.

Left out, as they cannot affect a Linux build: files not in the release
tarball, iOS/Android/ChromeOS/Mac/Windows-only files, tests and docs,
translations, CI configuration, PGO/orderfile pointers, submodule pointer
updates, DEPS.

Added: the tarball's stamp files for the new commit (stamps.py:
build/util/LASTCHANGE{,.committime}, gpu/config/gpu_lists_version.h,
skia/ext/skia_commit_hash.h, gpu/webgpu/DAWN_VERSION and
gpu/webgpu/dawn_commit_hash.h; commit 8ca8ac7c91861df368654316e72df3c0e9ca18e3,
refs/branch-heads/8127@{#1527}). build/util/MINIBRANCH doesn't change.

Checked: applies to the 158.0.8127.18 tarball; chrome/VERSION becomes
158.0.8127.33; every patched source file is byte-identical to its version
at the tag (or the dependency's DEPS revision); it adds 15 files and renames
20 (within chrome/browser/resources/omnibox_popup/; the old paths are gone); the
158.0.8127.18 tarball's non-git files are all classified (tarball-generated.py
with generated.conf).

Apply with git apply.

